{
  "slug": "nexus-the-cartographer",
  "name": "Nexus The Cartographer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI Cowork metabrain with Knowledge Graph, Thought Stack, Fuel Intelligence, and local AI Overseer. 20 native MCP tools for persistent session memory across Claude instances.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `nexus-audit` (Run a code audit using the local AI Overseer to analyze the codebase), `nexus-brief` (Get the current Nexus metabrain state — fuel, tasks, sessions, decisions, risks), `nexus-dashboard` (Launch the Nexus visual dashboard — Command, Fuel, Graph, Overseer, Log modules in the browser), `nexus-health` (Verify Nexus installation health — store, AI, hooks, tools), `nexus-plan` (Generate an AI-powered session plan based on fuel, tasks, and knowledge graph), `nexus-runway` (Check current session fuel runway against upcoming calendar events and recommend wrap-up time), `nexus-schedule` (Set up recurring Nexus audits and scans via mcp__scheduled-tasks__*), `nexus-status` (Quick metabrain status check — fuel, in-progress tasks, thought stack), and 1 more\n- **Agents** (1): `overseer`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `nexus`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install nexus-the-cartographer@claude-community` from `kronosderet/Nexus` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
